---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM (SELECT a, count(*) AS n FROM u GROUP BY a) g CROSS JOIN u v JOIN t ON g.a + v.a = t.a WHERE t.b = 'x'"
---
Project [a#5]
+- Join Inner, ((a#0 + a#3) == a#5)
   :- Join Inner
   :  :- Aggregate [a#0], [a#0]
   :  :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#0] (shared #1)
   :  +- Shift +3
   :     +- Shared #1, printed above
   +- Project [a#5]
      +- Filter (b#6 == 'x')
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#5, b#6]
